156
00:09:58,309 --> 00:10:00,146
Tulis pilihanmu di komentar,

157
00:10:00,146 --> 00:10:03,159
dan tekan tombol putih di bawah agar dapat hal-hal

158
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:04,221
yang nggak disangka!

